{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "114e79ac53da8d642043b6660b5b943eab48ffa5a618ba3c7aca6e7f77539392", "ja": "揺れる心", "zh": "动摇的心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2e8264a0f6d4699c434ac3c02bfa1a43209e1424a5368eb0db9ab14483a5b112", "ja": "I.V.で人気最下位である事を知る真珠星。\n当然だと思う反面、母の事がなくても本当に\n医者になりたいのか？と考える。そんな中、\nパスポートを取ろうとした真珠星は戸籍謄本\nから、自分が一宮家の養子だと知る。", "zh": "真珠星得知自己在I.V.中人气垫底。\n在觉得理所当然的同时，她也开始思考：\n即使没有母亲的事，自己真的想当医生吗？\n在此期间，准备办理护照的真珠星从户籍誊本中\n得知了自己是一宫家的养子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1000_032emi", "source_sha256": "ef9dbeacd53328f950e2c1d4590200acfdaaeb0459dc2b49cc22ba9cebc9a3c9", "ja": "お疲れさま、なるちゃん、クロエさん。\n今日の『I.V.』の大事なミーティングって、何？", "zh": "辛苦了，小鸣、克洛伊。今天关于《I.V.》的重要会议，是要做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "23e94a6e905d8a1757fbac1f819f1e6c1a0f9e97ac0e058ea607f0f7fac85d27", "ja": "私も知らない。\nそれより真珠星、笹森は？", "zh": "我也不知道。\n比起这个，真珠星，笹森呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "97f368ef1050bbdc17431b755b2f893542b7e8c16dc326ddb0ee7ff514475389", "ja": "藍さんは、急なお仕事で来られないそうです。\n最近、このパターンが多いね。", "zh": "听说藍小姐因为临时有工作，来不了了。最近这种情况很多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "9a0284a8962bf0d394ce6f8a33471b6d64e0957e563c6e9d4987743c6469c0a3", "ja": "うん……。\n藍さん、忙しいみたいで。", "zh": "嗯……\n听说蓝小姐最近好像很忙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "b9b862dbf95bdfe2e520bdbf5fd7187a32c1d008106319db9ec35569c3cda4c9", "ja": "『I.V.』不動のセンターだもん。\nソロのお仕事が多くなるのも当然だよね。", "zh": "毕竟是『I.V.』不可动摇的C位嘛。\n个人工作会变多也是理所当然的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "7052dec4000f75b8f209f15dec846e9056f16d710947c9047b773c74d8f1a188", "ja": "ファンクラブの推しメン登録でも、\nずっと一位だからな、あいつ。", "zh": "在粉丝俱乐部的本命成员登记里，她也一直是第一名。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "93dfec1f10c5c3faa8f9cc35d192a40a39d05c02d8cc1e71741752fc07320cba", "ja": "ファンクラブの推しメン登録？\n何、それ？", "zh": "粉丝俱乐部的推选成员登记？\n那是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "22381a9b569b408ae31aedf1fefef878393851ec860414579c4f4a26751c2ed0", "ja": "『I.V.』のFC専用アプリがあるでしょ？\nあれ、会員の人は推しメンバーを登録できるんだよ。", "zh": "不是有“I.V.”的粉丝俱乐部专属App嘛？\n那个可以让会员登记自己支持的成员哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "3b2865d35aba3d3a63369d940118f1bece7148f26eacac9b76226698019ddb3a", "ja": "……本当だ。\n先月も、先々月も、ずっと藍さんが一位……。", "zh": "……真的。\n上个月、上上个月，一直都是蓝小姐第一……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "85cc5dfab69f65957fd5f2131a362aad1c38a14c12aebbe011caa71b7fe85fb2", "ja": "……数字で負けると、やっぱ癪だな。\n海外に行く前に、こいつをなんとかしないと。", "zh": "……在数据上输了，果然还是很不甘心啊。\n去海外之前，必须得想办法扭转这个局面才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "e72e13b061b97befc3865a499df9da2a93d708177e1ba627a901f2cedc5aef0d", "ja": "えっと……あくまでチームの中で、\n切磋琢磨しよう、っていう意味ですよね……？", "zh": "那个……是说只在队伍里互相切磋、共同进步，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "ffeb9885b23e451b2f1454c14f929d93eb506421c26f479d2204b6316e51ce79", "ja": "（……私は、最下位。当たり前か。自分でも、なんで\nアイドルやってるのかわかってないんだもん……）", "zh": "（……我是最后一名。那也难怪。毕竟连我自己都不知道，\n自己为什么要当偶像……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "0ee9c1a4c97f5b8af23538785ac4d1d6259f50ba3cf8ed8f9f7d7337979a95f7", "ja": "（そもそも私、アイドルなんてなるはずじゃなかった。\nきっかけは、お姉ちゃんの代わりで……）", "zh": "（说到底，我本来就不该成为偶像的。\n起因只是代替姐姐……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "e0e1c23bf56a283885a034e590ea8a4bd537f609452e00863866f161729cd87d", "ja": "（私自身は、お医者さんになるつもりだった。\nお母さんの病気を治すために……）", "zh": "（我自己原本是打算成为医生的。\n为了治好妈妈的病……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "89a67f3ae3155f3667255c829e68f2d24681851864056a2d4b1d5d8829e1b560", "ja": "……ちゃん。\n……真珠星ちゃん。", "zh": "……。\n……真珠星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "c692eb46d2205448cd7b6f1ca02348974da00e02c505b4f00ee058df951a7962", "ja": "（でも……お母さんの病気が、治ったら？\nもしくは……私が、間に合わなかったら……）", "zh": "（可是……要是妈妈的病治好了呢？\n又或者……要是我没能及时赶到……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1016_032emi", "source_sha256": "9c50f0f81eaf9a0f0e149658f435cbb70eb6a06f3b22232ae860457bc1a68c3f", "ja": "（その時は……。それでも私は、\nお医者さんになりたいって、思えるのかな……？）", "zh": "（到那时候……即使如此，我还会觉得，\n自己想成为一名医生吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1017_032emi", "source_sha256": "d5b9dd760e8e027f4092eba8ef41c0c810db3ad81ddd3618e10b90b5a872b54e", "ja": "（……私が本当にやりたいことって、\nなんなんだろう……？）", "zh": "（……我真正想做的事情，\n到底是什么呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "c588aa1c0b3650f3684ab1585a2f296c9b3c0fbccf8c47ec06bf593347e83fb8", "ja": "真珠星？\n……真珠星！", "zh": "南船座？\n……南船座！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1019_032emi", "source_sha256": "408ae992516855a45996a393020dadd0ba1b1c9180ae9c95a0432e5d92eb4241", "ja": "ふぇっ！？\nは、はい！", "zh": "欸！？\n是、是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "a5be2e17f5f0552446e572d8b971fca3743c20a27a4312b9489b2881d98afae1", "ja": "今はミーティング中よ。\n話聞いてた？", "zh": "现在正在开会哦。\n你有在听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1021_032emi", "source_sha256": "4cefec4abef4c2e6129b63de5a06431ce2e3652c3036ff1087217becc079cdac", "ja": "す、すみません……。", "zh": "对、对不起……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "6cb21e1b97e3196c9358a28e8de9f3c18df2cb12500f64d62b696a6d99364071", "ja": "『I.V.』の今後に関わることだから、\n気を引き締めて。……それじゃ、続けるけど。", "zh": "这关乎『I.V.』的未来，\n都打起精神来。……那么，我接着说了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "562b01ece7a3af724db16500444b71337db100c95457f8747d9fdfc643b5a93d", "ja": "『I.V.』が、台湾で開催される音楽フェスに\nゲスト出演することが決まった。開催は半年後。", "zh": "已经决定让『I.V.』作为特邀嘉宾，\n参加在台湾举办的音乐节。举办时间是半年后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "dbcd9b335121237fa8ddc121ad9e84bd2768e001ac037d99e34fb61136777314", "ja": "海外のファン層を獲得する絶好のチャンスよ。\n今から準備して、きっちり仕上げましょう。", "zh": "这是争取海外粉丝群体的绝佳机会。现在就开始准备，认真做好充分准备吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1025_032emi", "source_sha256": "81af49847755b3035e48adb5a0a10a707b1925aa96700786a920c31edc8393f1", "ja": "（海外……。\nあ、私パスポート持ってないや……）", "zh": "（海外……。\n啊，我没有护照来着……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "0a1f8a7407a0c933fdae40a3945a5080fdb5bfaa7bb1195427b8e1be56fdaa2c", "ja": "（……み、みんなにバカにされる前に、\n調べて取りに行かなきゃ……！）", "zh": "（……在被大家嘲笑之前，\n得赶紧查查，然后去办一个……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1027_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1028_032emi", "source_sha256": "ee62df18276942ec7475a162b3b6b66b18e35459bc817986dcb65ffb8078c6b7", "ja": "証明写真も撮ったし……あとは、\nここで戸籍謄本をもらえばいいんだよね……。", "zh": "证件照也拍好了……接下来，在这里领取户籍誊本就行了吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1029_syokuin", "source_sha256": "890f16ab4380cedfcfc61bcb7bd6ea0b4346f7795392491daf0ae9ec713df7d2", "ja": "番号札3番の方、\n窓口までお越しください。", "zh": "请号码牌为3号的客人到窗口来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1030_032emi", "source_sha256": "09b5c649a7d58b1f96b1f9549da53a46fb63e4371b5823e86ee587544834eb8f", "ja": "よし、これで戸籍謄本が手に入っ……え？\nお父さんとお母さんの名前の欄、なに……？", "zh": "好，这样户籍誊本就拿到手了……咦？\n父亲和母亲姓名那一栏，这是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1031_032emi", "source_sha256": "7cf3b480a99c5bfb017bdfe7a109d1c289ad2e96b003a6b2f4f6647d3f33a20d", "ja": "養父、養母……？　養子、縁組……？　\n……本当の、お母さんの名前は……。", "zh": "养父、养母……？收养、结缘……？\n……亲生，母亲的名字是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0361_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0361_story_04_1032_032emi", "source_sha256": "1cf04b2f6ce76fd3d7644fa2e34385f6505c289c7579f9a210b7435b563aa93a", "ja": "神宮寺七星（ななせ）……神宮寺？\nど、どういうこと……？", "zh": "神宫寺七星（Nanase）……神宫寺？\n这、这是怎么回事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
